  {
   "id": 666471,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What's the code's output if the line <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">count += 1</code> is replaced with <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">count *= 2</code>?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328466,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">0</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "Since the initial <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">count</code>'s value is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">0</code>, multiplying <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">count</code> by any number results in the output of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">0</code>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328467,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">16</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The statement <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">count *= 2</code> multiplies the value of count by 2 in each iteration."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328468,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code><sup><code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">8</code></sup>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "While 8 characters exist in the string variable <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">str_var</code>, and the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">count *2</code> is executed for 20 times, the count's initialization value is 0."
    }
